  "$id": "urn:btx:security:record:v1",
  "title": "BTX security-v2 signed record",
  "description": "Shape only. C++ enforces signatures, authority, canonical integer JSON, bounds, clocks, closure and effects. An empty signature list is only an unsigned draft; not authority.",
